    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "*gasp* *gasp*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "We made it...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've not only managed to shake off Reunion...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "...but the Catastrophe is also visibly weakening!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we're still in a terrible situation... Everyone, continue to exercise caution!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Catastrophe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The streets are now buried underneath rubble, and collapsed buildings are blocking all the roads...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is the Originium already beginning to metastasize...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're almost there, but everything is blocking our way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we can just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "... Just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion? They caught up to us? !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's... so many of them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "They didn't just catch up to us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "--Everywhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "From the plaza, the streets, the buildings... and even all the ruins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at those numbers. Hah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "That explains why they weren't afraid of the Catastrophe at all, except for the ones who ended up being crushed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if we assume...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "That the Catastrophe wiped out half their men--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "They still have enough people here to kill us a dozen times over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't stop moving! We'll continue moving towards our retreat route!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're done for if we stop in a wide-open area! At least make it to the plaza's exit before regrouping!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nearl...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We have to fight. After we break through their line, we'll slip out in the ensuing chaos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure it'll work?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The chance is slim, but we're out of options. But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if they outnumber us ten-to-one, if they're just a bunch of thugs, we still have a chance!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay calm! Prepare for battle! Defensive formations!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Tsk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "With these numbers, if they wanted to take over Chernobog... they might actually be able to do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_148_nearl_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are too many...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Way too many of them..",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where did Reunion find all these Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nearl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're completely surrounded...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never asked for this kind of respect from Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "text": "The entire plaza... is swarming with Reunion forces!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "They've stopped moving!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
